@startuml
title S-CORE Lifecycle Collector | Transport Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #F5F5F5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #4F5D75
skinparam activityBorderColor #2D3142
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityFontColor #2D3142
skinparam diamondBorderColor #4F5D75
skinparam diamondBackgroundColor #ECECEC
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #BFC0C0

start
:Launch Manager emits process life status
(comp_req_launch_man_ext_monitor_notify);
:Collector reads ProcessState / GraphState
(ProcessInfoNode::getState(), Graph::getState());
:Collector receives Health Monitor supervision status
(supervision_status, failed_supervision_type, deadline_error, heartbeat_error, logic_error, deadline_violation, failed_supervision_cycles, alive_indication_count);
#FFF1E9:VEL Lifecycle Collector maps fields
(C++ binding to Launch Manager & Health Monitor API);
:Produce raw state record
(conforms to score-lifecycle-state RawEvidenceSchema);
:Schema Validator validates raw state record;
:Normalization Processor maps to normalized Vehicle Evidence;
:Publish normalized Vehicle Evidence
(DDS topic ScoreNormalizedEvidence, reliable);
stop

note right
Read-only: the collector never sends
control commands to the Launch Manager.
end note
@enduml
